l stats, saves, armour, and defense bonuses by %d%% on equipment that is crafted by a master or powered by steamtech.","source_tag":"tformat","target":"你对物理学的了解令你能以全新的方式改进装备。\n\t\t增加大师制作或者蒸汽科技的装备提供的属性、豁免、护甲和闪避 %d%%。"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"7d51821ad2ad40d642dac14c6b8a2ff0b4fc5bf7ca6ff393dcd6b5b7c1b79e6e","component":"orcs","entry_revision_identity":"58fefd8e319421aa5b42b932da539a982d90aa4029796180ff2badc86d7300cf","logical_entry_identity":"613ed015b5c2c66c50972504bfd38d13a33e09deccf055a256b3437bc55b9ac0","normalized_path":"tome-orcs.lua","source":"a journal (6)","source_tag":"_t","target":"一份日志 (6)"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"05f2fb9d4c90939bf18eae553946022dc3fe32e5eb19b878483f19cf5cf8c4e4","component":"orcs","entry_revision_identity":"59254697c101e97509436e274a8d086c69ae64bede412bfab6bdecd8c2c0db2b","logical_entry_identity":"d4fcc90b9f9efbf91f76541ee54ac15cc6c919c205f79d275e29076a615c96f9","normalized_path":"tome-orcs.lua","source":"Sorry, I have to go!","source_tag":"_t","target":"抱歉，我要走了！"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"0e9fa40c74c51706a3f708bd99ddf4a86d5e5f10f10e06e7560db3216b04e83e","component":"orcs","entry_revision_identity":"5929c6ece9593415ed0a9eed3bb2fffa4f7d0b2ebdcfee42089ede3ab590854c","logical_entry_identity":"8e39b6e424ad36aee7f915b11ce66e0ed950ed834a4a6612a6209bebdc5f2870","normalized_path":"tome-orcs.lua","source":"Way into old ruins in the Erúan desert","source_tag":"entity name","target":"通向艾露安沙漠古老遗迹的路"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"4145da5b8821d46797acc260536532405d1130b84535da7ae201f77da80b7e28","component":"orcs","entry_revision_identity":"595abf50af19058d5077d7db688f4af6e8f3ce106deb519df51f4769ad9bbfbd","logical_entry_identity":"0f363ae59b2bf159c612f4ba96d903b3e6f4a8cff94022fde868a3a2cbab6fa7","normalized_path":"tome-orcs.lua","source":"#GOLD#The light of the Amulet envelops you, then subsides. You feel stronger. (+1 Prodigy Points)","source_tag":"saySimple","target":"#GOLD#神的光辉充盈着你的全身，然后渐渐消退。你感觉更加强大了。（+1觉醒点）"},